        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a series of Python files for key management and encryption using Google Cloud KMS. I need to create the initial file encrypt_payload.py using Google Cloud KMS, and then create the remaining files as specified. Each scored implementation file must use one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code. The local helper files may contain configuration loading, payload normalization, or response parsing utilities when useful. </thinking>\n\n",
